      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195680\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195680\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Group A3, B1, B2 and B3 refrigerants shall not be used in high-probability air conditioning systems for human comfort. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195681\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195681\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;Exceptions:<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195682\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195682\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Sealed absorption and unit air-conditioning systems having refrigerant quantities not exceeding those set forth in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-195633', hash: '#JD_MCTable1103.1' }}\">Table 1103.1<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195683\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195683\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;2.&#160;&#160;&#160;Industrial occupancies.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195684\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195684\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Nothing in this section shall be construed to allow the use of Group A3 and B3 refrigerants if otherwise prohibited. <\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195685\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195685\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_MCTable1104.3.1\" id=\"JD_MCTable1104.3.1\" title=\"MC Table 1104.3.1\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 1104.3.1<br><\/br>Special Quantity Limits for Sealed Ammonia\/Water Absorption and Self-Contained Systems<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-195686\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-195686\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>",
      "id" : "24008-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "Group A3, B1, B2 and B3 refrigerants shall not be used in high-probability air conditioning systems for human comfort. \n\n Exceptions: \n\n 1. Sealed absorption and unit air-conditioning systems having refrigerant quantities not exceeding those set forth in Table 1103.1 .\n\n 2. Industrial occupancies.\n\n Nothing in this section shall be construed to allow the use of Group A3 and B3 refrigerants if otherwise prohibited. \n\n Table 1104.3.1\n Special Quantity Limits for Sealed Ammonia\/Water Absorption and Self-Contained Systems"
    },
